{"version":1,"content":"<p>陸劇小生成毅成立個人工作室後的首部作品《兩京十五日》近日開播，劇中他拋下「偶包」，化身「髒髒包太子」逃亡，更親自演繹落水及爆破場面。</p><p>傾盡全力的演出獲海量粉絲包場支持，花費逾2千萬港元力挺亦毫不手軟。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T16:13:53.210421+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T16:01:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:08.061239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:08.061239+00:00","content_hash":"d90370289ca1842331ba3b956ad47f82527841df0059436d2f5c74a8406f9e6f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}